      "description": "Visible status buttons below title; remove action remains separate.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-watch\"><button class=\"ds-watch-icon ds-drag\" aria-label=\"Reorder film title\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"5\" r=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"15\" cy=\"5\" r=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"12\" r=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"15\" cy=\"12\" r=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"19\" r=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"15\" cy=\"19\" r=\"1.5\"/></svg></button><button class=\"ds-watch-title\"><span class=\"ds-watch-poster\"><svg width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" viewBox=\"0 0 684 1026\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n  <defs>\n    <linearGradient id=\"bg\" x1=\"38\" y1=\"72\" x2=\"646\" y2=\"978\" gradientUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\">\n      <stop stop-color=\"#0E141D\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"0.46\" stop-color=\"#090E15\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#03060A\"/>\n    </linearGradient>\n    <radialGradient id=\"mist\" cx=\"0\" cy=\"0\" r=\"1\" gradientUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" gradientTransform=\"translate(198 210) rotate(60) scale(342 286)\">\n      <stop stop-color=\"#7E91A8\" stop-opacity=\"0.03\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#7E91A8\" stop-opacity=\"0\"/>\n    </radialGradient>\n    <radialGradient id=\"glow\" cx=\"0\" cy=\"0\" r=\"1\" gradientUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" gradientTransform=\"translate(342 513) rotate(90) scale(280 320)\">\n      <stop stop-color=\"#EE3C3C\" stop-opacity=\"0.14\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#EE3C3C\" stop-opacity=\"0\"/>\n    </radialGradient>\n    <linearGradient id=\"mark\" x1=\"258\" y1=\"419\" x2=\"426\" y2=\"607\" gradientUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\">\n      <stop stop-color=\"#FF6B6B\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"0.6\" stop-color=\"#EE3C3C\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#C92121\"/>\n    </linearGradient>\n  </defs>\n\n  <rect width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" rx=\"32\" fill=\"url(#bg)\"/>\n  <rect width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" rx=\"32\" fill=\"url(#mist)\"/>\n  <rect width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" rx=\"32\" fill=\"url(#glow)\"/>\n\n  <circle cx=\"342\" cy=\"513\" r=\"112\" fill=\"#EE3C3C\" fill-opacity=\"0.07\"/>\n  <circle cx=\"342\" cy=\"513\" r=\"84\" stroke=\"#EE3C3C\" stroke-opacity=\"0.16\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n\n  <g stroke=\"url(#mark)\" stroke-width=\"14\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\n    <rect x=\"265\" y=\"436\" width=\"154\" height=\"154\" rx=\"22\"/>\n    <path d=\"M304 436V590\"/>\n    <path d=\"M380 436V590\"/>\n    <path d=\"M265 474H304\"/>\n    <path d=\"M265 513H419\"/>\n    <path d=\"M265 552H304\"/>\n    <path d=\"M380 474H419\"/>\n    <path d=\"M380 552H419\"/>\n  </g>\n</svg>\n</span><span><strong>Film title</strong><small>Movie</small></span></button><button class=\"ds-watch-icon ds-remove\" aria-label=\"Remove from watchlist\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 6h18M9 6V4h6v2M5 6l1 14h12l1-14M10 10v6M14 10v6\"/></svg></button><div class=\"ds-watch-statuses\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Status for film title\"><button class=\"ds-status\" aria-pressed=\"true\">Saved</button><button class=\"ds-status\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Watching</button><button class=\"ds-status\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Completed</button><button class=\"ds-status\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Dropped</button></div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-watch{font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;display:grid;grid-template-columns:44px minmax(0,1fr) 44px;gap:12px 4px;width:340px;max-width:100%;padding:12px;border-radius:12px;background:hsl(var(--muted,20 5% 15%) / .25);color:hsl(var(--foreground,20 8% 98%));transition:background-color 200ms;}.ds-watch:hover{background:hsl(var(--accent,357 76% 14%) / .3);}.ds-watch-icon{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex:none;width:44px;height:44px;padding:0;border:0;border-radius:8px;background:transparent;color:hsl(var(--muted-foreground,20 6% 70%));cursor:pointer;}.ds-drag{cursor:grab;}.ds-drag:active{cursor:grabbing;}.ds-watch-title{font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;min-width:0;padding:0;border:0;border-radius:8px;background:transparent;color:hsl(var(--foreground,20 8% 98%));text-align:left;cursor:pointer;}.ds-watch-poster{display:block;width:48px;height:72px;flex:none;overflow:hidden;border-radius:6px;}.ds-watch-title strong{display:-webkit-box;-webkit-line-clamp:2;-webkit-box-orient:vertical;overflow:hidden;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.375;overflow-wrap:anywhere;}.ds-watch-title small{display:block;margin-top:2px;font-size:12px;color:hsl(var(--muted-foreground,20 6% 70%));}.ds-watch-statuses{display:grid;grid-column:1/-1;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:4px;padding-top:8px;border-top:1px solid hsl(var(--border,20 5% 18%) / .6);}.ds-status{font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;min-height:44px;min-width:0;padding:0 4px;border:0;border-radius:6px;background:transparent;color:hsl(var(--muted-foreground,20 6% 70%));font-size:12px;font-weight:500;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 200ms,color 200ms;}.ds-status[aria-pressed=\"true\"]{background:hsl(var(--primary,357 92% 48%) / .15);color:hsl(var(--foreground,20 8% 98%));box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px hsl(var(--primary,357 92% 48%) / .4);}.ds-status:not([aria-pressed=\"true\"]):hover{background:hsl(var(--muted,20 5% 15%));color:hsl(var(--foreground,20 8% 98%));}.ds-watch-title:hover strong{color:hsl(var(--primary,357 92% 48%));}.ds-watch-icon:hover{color:hsl(var(--foreground,20 8% 98%));}.ds-remove:hover{color:hsl(var(--destructive,0 84% 60%));background:hsl(var(--destructive,0 84% 60%) / .1);}.ds-watch button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid hsl(var(--ring,357 92% 48%));outline-offset:3px;}.ds-watch button:disabled{opacity:.5;}@media(min-width:400px){.ds-watch-statuses{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));}}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "MovieReckon's existing cinematic browsing interface",
    "overview": "MovieReckon retains its warm near-black canvas, red identity, existing logo, and Inter typography. Real film and series artwork carries the visual interest; clear titles, compact metadata, and useful actions support choosing the next watch. Stan, Prime Video, and Netflix inform browsing clarity within this established identity.\n\nThis records the implemented shared navigation, home hero, shelves, poster cards, watchlist entries, and recurring detail patterns. Other routes retain some older glass and gradient treatments; this document does not imply a complete migration.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Warm dark neutrals with solid red actions and selected states.",
      "Catalog photography, readable scrims, and portrait poster shelves.",
      "One sans-serif family with strong titles and quiet metadata.",
      "Responsive navigation and visible, separate watchlist status choices."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Red Action Rule",
        "body": "Use solid brand red for primary actions. Selected controls may use red tints with light labels. Keep ordinary text and resting surfaces neutral so artwork remains prominent.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Title Before Metadata Rule",
        "body": "Place a semibold title below poster artwork, then quieter metadata. Allow two title lines instead of squeezing the type.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Readable Artwork Rule",
        "body": "Use dark scrims to support text over photography. Keep poster artwork unobstructed at rest apart from useful metadata badges.",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do preserve the MovieReckon logo, name, red identity, and established font stack.",
      "Do show ratings, release years, and recommendation explanations only when supplied by product data.",
      "Do retain the 44px controls used by refined navigation, poster actions, shelf arrows, and watchlist entries, with visible keyboard focus.",
      "Do show all four watchlist statuses as buttons, with a separate remove action beside the title.",
      "Do retain the hero pause control and interaction pause behavior, including its reduced-motion handling."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't fill primary actions with gradients; the refined primary action is solid red.",
      "Don't hide watchlist statuses in a dropdown; the user selected visible choices.",
      "Don't rely on hover alone for essential poster actions; the implemented pattern also responds to focus and coarse pointers.",
      "Don't transform the shared frame or route wrapper around fixed navigation; the frame is static and route transitions change opacity.",
      "Don't promote legacy glass icon tiles, decorative kickers, glyph headings, or large glows into the default for new surfaces."
    ]
  }
}
